# Old soldiers: patient, use the ground, hold their fire, very hard to break.
drill "Veterans"
about "Patient: use the ground, hold fire until it counts, very hard to break."
type Ironside
dials aggression 0.55 discipline 0.75 cohesion 0.60 cover 0.55 patience 0.80 nerve 0.90

sergeant:
  when enemy beyond 40 -> hold fire
  when enemy within 40 -> volley when 70% loaded

man:
  when volley called and loaded and enemy within 50 -> fire
  otherwise -> follow sergeant
